# ⚔️ GRINDR — Level Up Your Life

> Turn your daily habits into RPG quests. Complete tasks, earn XP, unlock achievements, and level up your real life.

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Completed-success)
![HTML](https://img.shields.io/badge/HTML5-✔-orange)
![CSS](https://img.shields.io/badge/CSS3-✔-blue)
![JavaScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/JavaScript-ES6-yellow)

---

## 📖 About

**GRINDR** is a gamified productivity web application inspired by RPG progression systems.

Instead of managing a boring to-do list, users become a hero who completes daily quests, earns experience (XP), levels up, unlocks new classes, and collects achievements.

The goal is to make self-improvement fun and motivating through game mechanics.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🧝 Hero System
- Create your own hero
- Save your hero's name
- Character avatar
- Hero class progression
- Level system

### ⚡ XP & Leveling
- Earn XP by completing quests
- Dynamic XP progress bar
- Automatic level-up system
- Total XP tracking

### 📜 Daily Quest System
- Add custom quests
- Choose quest difficulty
  - Easy (10 XP)
  - Normal (20 XP)
  - Hard (35 XP)
  - Epic (50 XP)
- Complete quests
- Reset daily progress

### 🏆 Achievements
Unlock achievements based on your progress.

Examples:
- First Quest
- Quest Master
- XP Hunter
- Streak Champion
- Legendary Hero

### 📊 Statistics
Track your journey with:

- Total Quests Completed
- Current Day Streak
- Total XP Earned
- Days Active

### ⚔ Class Hierarchy
Progress through different hero classes as you gain XP.

Example progression:

```
Wanderer
   ↓
Adventurer
   ↓
Knight
   ↓
Elite Knight
   ↓
Champion
   ↓
Legend
```

### 📜 Chronicle Log
Every important action is recorded.

Examples:
- Completed a quest
- Level Up
- Achievement Unlocked
- New Hero Created

