## 🚀 Getting Started

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/grindr.git
```

### Open the project

Simply open

```
index.html
```

in your browser.

No installation or build tools are required.

---

## 🎮 How to Play

1. Enter your hero's name.
2. Save your character.
3. Add daily quests.
4. Select quest difficulty.
5. Complete quests to earn XP.
6. Level up your hero.
7. Unlock achievements.
8. Build long streaks and become legendary.

