## 🎨 Design Philosophy

GRINDR combines:

- Minimal UI
- Fantasy RPG aesthetics
- Clean typography
- Gamification
- Motivation through progression

The application transforms everyday productivity into an engaging role-playing experience.

---

## 🧠 Motivation

Most productivity apps become repetitive over time.

GRINDR makes everyday tasks feel like quests by rewarding consistency with XP, achievements, and character progression, encouraging users to build better habits while having fun.

